### AutoHub API - Support Tickets Demo Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@portalUrl = http://rederevenda.com
@tenant1Url = http://autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### =========================================================================
### Lojista Support Tickets Endpoints
### =========================================================================

### 1. List Store Tickets (Lojista View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 2. Create New Support Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

{
  "title": "Dúvida sobre integração de fotos",
  "category": "suporte",
  "message": "Olá, estou com problemas para carregar fotos em lote nos meus veículos."
}

### 3. Get Ticket Details (including Messages & Timeline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets/1
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 4. Send Lojista Reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets/1/reply
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

{
  "message": "Tentei limpar o cache do navegador e ainda não funcionou."
}

### 5. Close Ticket (Lojista)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets/1/close
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 6. Rate Closed Ticket (1-5 stars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets/1/rate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

{
  "rating": 5
}

### 7. Reopen Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/tickets/1/reopen
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com


### =========================================================================
### Central Admin Support Endpoints
### =========================================================================

### 8. List All Support Tickets (Admin Help Desk View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

### 9. Admin Reply to Lojista Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets/1/reply
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

{
  "message": "Olá! Verificamos o seu problema e o redimensionador de fotos foi reiniciado. Pode tentar novamente?"
}

### 10. Admin Update Ticket Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets/1/category
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

{
  "category": "tecnico"
}
